## Anti Patterns

### 1. Using Verbs in URLs

```yaml
# Không nên
GET /api/getUsers
POST /api/createUser
PUT /api/updateUser
DELETE /api/deleteUser

# Nên
GET /api/users
POST /api/users
PUT /api/users/{id}
DELETE /api/users/{id}
```

### 2. Returning Inconsistent Status Codes

```typescript
// Không nên - inconsistent status codes
app.get('/users/:id', async (req, res) => {
    const user = await db.users.findById(req.params.id);
    if (!user) {
        return res.json({ error: 'Not found' }); // Should be 404!
    }
    return res.status(200).json(user);
});

// Nên - consistent status codes
app.get('/users/:id', async (req, res) => {
    const user = await db.users.findById(req.params.id);
    if (!user) {
        return res.status(404).json({
            error: { code: 'NOT_FOUND', message: 'User not found' }
        });
    }
    return res.status(200).json(user);
});
```

### 3. Missing Error Details

```typescript
// Không nên - generic error
app.post('/users', async (req, res) => {
    try {
        await createUser(req.body);
        res.status(201).json({ success: true });
    } catch (error) {
        res.status(500).json({ error: 'Server error' });
    }
});

// Nên - detailed error handling
app.post('/users', async (req, res) => {
    try {
        const user = await createUser(req.body);
        res.status(201).json(user);
    } catch (error) {
        if (error instanceof ValidationError) {
            return res.status(422).json({
                error: {
                    code: 'VALIDATION_ERROR',
                    message: error.message,
                    details: error.details
                }
            });
        }
        if (error instanceof DuplicateError) {
            return res.status(409).json({
                error: {
                    code: 'DUPLICATE_ENTRY',
                    message: error.message
                }
            });
        }
        res.status(500).json({
            error: {
                code: 'INTERNAL_ERROR',
                message: 'An unexpected error occurred'
            }
        });
    }
});
```

### 4. No Pagination

```typescript
// Không nên - returning all records
app.get('/users', async (req, res) => {
    const users = await db.users.findAll();
    res.json(users); // Could be thousands!
});

// Nên - paginated response
app.get('/users', async (req, res) => {
    const { page = 1, limit = 20 } = req.query;
    const offset = (Number(page) - 1) * Number(limit);

    const { rows: users, count } = await db.users.findAndCountAll({
        limit: Number(limit),
        offset
    });

    res.json({
        data: users,
        pagination: {
            page: Number(page),
            limit: Number(limit),
            totalItems: count,
            totalPages: Math.ceil(count / Number(limit))
        }
    });
});
```

### 5. Versioning via Date

```yaml
# Không nên - date-based versioning
GET /api/users/2024-01-15

# Nên - semantic versioning
GET /api/v1/users
GET /api/v2/users
```

